        "original_id": "a3ab8ecb-a113-53e4-9106-99fc305dbe1a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Nic Cester, Chris Cester, Cameron Muncey\n- Organizations: Jet\n- Products: Cold Hard Bitch, Rollover DJ, Get Born\n\nFacts:\n- Get Born was released on 14 September 2003 as Jet's debut album.\n- Cold Hard Bitch was written by Jet band members Chris Cester, Nic Cester, and Cameron Muncey.\n- Cold Hard Bitch was released in March 2004.\n- Rollover DJ was released by the Australian rock band Jet as a single from Get Born.\n- Rollover DJ was Jet's second single in most markets, but it was the third single in the United States after Cold Hard Bitch.\n- Nic Cester was born on 6 July 1979.\n- Nic Cester is an Australian singer-songwriter and guitarist.\n- Nic Cester is the frontman of Jet alongside his younger brother Chris.",
